<title>USA: Polaris names Malone CFO.</title>
<headline>Polaris names Malone CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polaris Industries Inc said on Friday Michael Malone would become chief financial officer effective January 15, replacing John Grunewald, who is retiring.</p>
<p>Malone is currently vice president for administration of the snowmobile, all-terrain vehicle and personal watercraft maker.</p>
<p>Shares of Polaris were up 1/2 at 23-1/4 Friday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
